<title>INDIA: Bombay bourse trading to begin 30 minutes late.</title>
<headline>Bombay bourse trading to begin 30 minutes late.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the Bombay Stock Exchange will begin 30 minutes later at 10:30 a.m. (0500 GMT) on Monday due to the death of a member broker last week, the exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
